Ingredients: PROGRESSIVE TRANCE + SINGER/SONGWRITER + CELESTIAL, SPACE & ORBITAL + Fiddle  
Creative Catalyst: Its rhythms mimic the heartbeat patterns of hibernating arctic animals.

Brumal Uplift is an uncanny, hyper-atmospheric fusion where the sweeping, cosmic euphoria of progressive trance collides with the bare, confessional intimacy of singer-songwriter folk. Instead of standard four-on-the-floor metronomic kicks, tracks are propelled by erratic, ultra-slow diastolic thuds based on hibernating mammal bio-telemetry. Against this sparse, shivering bedrock, an acoustic fiddle—heavily contact-miked, raspy with rosin, and routed through interplanetary pitch-shifting delays—takes the role of the soaring trance lead, weaving around vulnerable, breath-fogged whispered vocals that sound as if they were recorded inside a frozen spacesuit orbiting an abandoned planet.

