- Dynamics: Glacial, patient builds spanning several minutes where acoustic fiddle scraping and spoken-word confessions slowly freeze over, erupting not into a conventional peak-time synth drop, but into a massive, weightless explosion of orbital harmonics, thundering permafrost kicks, and soaring, polyphonic folk lines.

